{"id":"8bc3657abc7260f5633ce47242db6c1b0fb5909a","axis":"silent","repo":"systemd/systemd","sha":"8bc3657abc7260f5633ce47242db6c1b0fb5909a","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"NEWS","lines":["@@ -153,6 +153,13 @@ CHANGES WITH 263 in spe:","           The reason is also exposed in the new ConfiguringReasons field of","           the interface description provided over Varlink."," ","+        * The [DHCPServerStaticLease] section gained new ClientIdentifier=,","+          IAID=, DUIDType=, and DUIDRawData= settings. With","+          ClientIdentifier=duid, a static address is assigned to a client","+          based on the IAID and DUID it sends, instead of its hardware","+          address. This is useful e.g. to tell apart hosts that share a","+          hardware address, like ipvlan interfaces in L2 mode.","+","         Changes in systemd-sysupdate:"," ","         * systemd-sysupdate's \"update\" command acquired a new --loop= switch."],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"man/systemd.network.xml","lines":["@@ -4371,23 +4371,64 @@ ServerAddress=192.168.0.1/24</programlisting>","   <refsect1>","     <title>[DHCPServerStaticLease] Section Options</title>","     <para>The <literal>[DHCPServerStaticLease]</literal> section configures a static DHCP lease to assign a","-    fixed IPv4 address to a specific device based on its MAC address. This section can be specified multiple","-    times.</para>","+    fixed IPv4 address to a specific device based on its MAC address or client identifier. This section can be","+    specified multiple times.</para>"," ","     <variablelist class='network-directives'>","       <varlistentry>","         <term><varname>MACAddress=</varname></term>"," ","-        <listitem><para>The hardware address of a device to match. This key is mandatory.</para>","+        <listitem><para>The hardware address of a device to match. This key is mandatory when","+        <varname>ClientIdentifier=</varname> is <option>mac</option>, and ignored when it is","+        <option>duid</option>.</para>"," ","         <xi:include href=\"version-info.xml\" xpointer=\"v249\"/></listitem>","       </varlistentry>"," ","+      <varlistentry>","+        <term><varname>ClientIdentifier=</varname></term>","+","+        <listitem><para>Specifies how the client identifier (option 61) of a device to match is built, as in","+        the [DHCPv4] section. Takes one of <option>mac</option> or <option>duid</option>. When","+        <option>mac</option>, the client identifier is built from <varname>MACAddress=</varname>. As the","+        server falls back to the hardware address of a device when no static lease matches the client","+        identifier the device sends, such a lease matches the device whatever client identifier it sends.","+        When <option>duid</option>, the client identifier is built from <varname>IAID=</varname> and the","+        DUID specified by <varname>DUIDType=</varname> and <varname>DUIDRawData=</varname> (RFC 4361), and","+        all of them must be specified. Such a lease matches only a device that sends exactly that client","+        identifier. This is useful e.g. to tell apart hosts that share a hardware address, like ipvlan","+        interfaces in L2 mode. Defaults to <option>mac</option>.</para>","+","+        <xi:include href=\"version-info.xml\" xpointer=\"v263\"/></listitem>","+      </varlistentry>","+","+      <varlistentry>","+        <term><varname>IAID=</varname></term>","+","+        <listitem><para>The IAID of a device to match, a 32-bit unsigned integer, as in the [DHCPv4] section of","+        the client. Used only when <varname>ClientIdentifier=duid</varname>.</para>","+","+        <xi:include href=\"version-info.xml\" xpointer=\"v263\"/></listitem>","+      </varlistentry>","+","+      <varlistentry>","+        <term><varname>DUIDType=</varname></term>","+        <term><varname>DUIDRawData=</varname></term>","+","+        <listitem><para>The DUID of a device to match, as in the [DHCPv4] section of the client. See","+        <citerefentry><refentrytitle>networkd.conf</refentrytitle><manvolnum>5</manvolnum></citerefentry>","+        for the format. As the DUID cannot be generated on the server side, both must be specified when","+        <varname>ClientIdentifier=duid</varname>, and they are ignored otherwise.</para>","+","+        <xi:include href=\"version-info.xml\" xpointer=\"v263\"/></listitem>","+      </varlistentry>","+","       <varlistentry>","         <term><varname>Address=</varname></term>"," ","         <listitem><para>The IPv4 address that should be assigned to the device that was matched with","-        <varname>MACAddress=</varname>. This key is mandatory.</para>","+        <varname>MACAddress=</varname> or <varname>ClientIdentifier=</varname>. This key is","+        mandatory.</para>"," ","         <xi:include href=\"version-info.xml\" xpointer=\"v249\"/></listitem>","       </varlistentry>","@@ -4400,7 +4441,7 @@ ServerAddress=192.168.0.1/24</programlisting>","         <literal>mydevice.example.com</literal>), following RFC 1123 naming conventions. Each label can be","         up to 63 characters, with a total maximum length of 253 characters for FQDNs. When this option is","         set, the DHCP server will include the hostname in DHCP replies (both OFFER and ACK) to the client","-        with the matched MAC address.</para>","+        with the matched MAC address or client identifier.</para>"," ","         <para>The server automatically selects the appropriate DHCP option based on the hostname format:","         simple hostnames (single DNS label) are sent via option 12 (Host Name) per RFC 2132, while FQDNs"],"additions":46,"deletions":5,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/network/networkd-dhcp-common.c","lines":["@@ -1268,7 +1268,7 @@ int config_parse_duid_type(","         duid->type = type;","         duid->set = force;"," ","-        return 0;","+        return 1;"," }"," "," int config_parse_manager_duid_type(","@@ -1388,7 +1388,7 @@ int config_parse_duid_rawdata(","         duid->raw_data_len = count;","         duid->set = force;"," ","-        return 0;","+        return 1;"," }"," "," int config_parse_manager_duid_rawdata("],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/network/networkd-dhcp-server-static-lease.c","lines":["@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@"," #include \"hashmap.h\""," #include \"networkd-dhcp-server-static-lease.h\""," #include \"networkd-network.h\"","+#include \"parse-util.h\""," #include \"string-util.h\""," "," static DHCPStaticLease* dhcp_static_lease_free(DHCPStaticLease *static_lease) {","@@ -17,7 +18,6 @@ static DHCPStaticLease* dhcp_static_lease_free(DHCPStaticLease *static_lease) {","                 hashmap_remove(static_lease->network->dhcp_static_leases_by_section, static_lease->section);"," ","         config_section_free(static_lease->section);","-        free(static_lease->client_id);","         free(static_lease->hostname);","         return mfree(static_lease);"," }","@@ -34,10 +34,15 @@ static int dhcp_static_lease_new(DHCPStaticLease **ret) {"," ","         assert(ret);"," ","-        p = new0(DHCPStaticLease, 1);","+        p = new(DHCPStaticLease, 1);","         if (!p)","                 return -ENOMEM;"," ","+        *p = (DHCPStaticLease) {","+                .client_identifier = DHCP_CLIENT_ID_MAC,","+                .duid.type = _DUID_TYPE_INVALID,","+        };","+","         *ret = TAKE_PTR(p);","         return 0;"," }","@@ -78,6 +83,8 @@ static int lease_new_static(Network *network, const char *filename, unsigned sec"," }"," "," static int static_lease_verify(DHCPStaticLease *static_lease) {","+        int r;","+","         if (section_is_invalid(static_lease->section))","                 return -EINVAL;"," ","@@ -89,13 +96,47 @@ static int static_lease_verify(DHCPStaticLease *static_lease) {"," ","         /* TODO: check that the address is in the pool. */"," ","-        if (static_lease->client_id_size == 0 || !static_lease->client_id)","-                return log_warning_errno(SYNTHETIC_ERRNO(EINVAL),","-                                         \"%s: DHCP static lease without MACAddress= field configured. \"","-                                         \"Ignoring [DHCPServerStaticLease] section from line %u.\",","-                                         static_lease->section->filename, static_lease->section->line);","+        switch (static_lease->client_identifier) {","+        case DHCP_CLIENT_ID_MAC:","+                if (ether_addr_is_null(&static_lease->hw_addr))","+                        return log_warning_errno(SYNTHETIC_ERRNO(EINVAL),","+                                                 \"%s: DHCP static lease without MACAddress= field configured. \"","+                                                 \"Ignoring [DHCPServerStaticLease] section from line %u.\",","+                                                 static_lease->section->filename, static_lease->section->line);","+","+                /* set client id type to 1: Ethernet Link-Layer (RFC 2132) */","+                r = sd_dhcp_client_id_set(&static_lease->client_id, 1, &static_lease->hw_addr, ETH_ALEN);","+                break;","+","+        case DHCP_CLIENT_ID_DUID: {","+                sd_dhcp_duid duid = {};","+","+                /* MACAddress= is ignored here, as the client identifier does not contain it. */","+","+                if (!static_lease->iaid_set ||","+                    static_lease->duid.type < 0 ||","+                    static_lease->duid.raw_data_len == 0)","+                        return log_warning_errno(SYNTHETIC_ERRNO(EINVAL),","+                                                 \"%s: DHCP static lease with ClientIdentifier=duid requires IAID=, \"","+                                                 \"DUIDType=, and DUIDRawData= fields configured. \"","+                                                 \"Ignoring [DHCPServerStaticLease] section from line %u.\",","+                                                 static_lease->section->filename, static_lease->section->line);","+","+                r = sd_dhcp_duid_set(&duid, static_lease->duid.type,","+                                     static_lease->duid.raw_data, static_lease->duid.raw_data_len);","+                if (r >= 0)","+                        r = sd_dhcp_client_id_set_iaid_duid(&static_lease->client_id, static_lease->iaid, &duid);","+                break;","+        }"," ","-        assert(static_lease->client_id_size == ETH_ALEN + 1);","+        default:","+                assert_not_reached();","+        }","+        if (r < 0)","+                return log_warning_errno(r,","+                                         \"%s: Failed to set client ID of DHCP static lease. \"","+                                         \"Ignoring [DHCPServerStaticLease] section from line %u: %m\",","+                                         static_lease->section->filename, static_lease->section->line);"," ","         return 0;"," }","@@ -174,7 +215,6 @@ int config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_hwaddr(","         _cleanup_(dhcp_static_lease_free_or_set_invalidp) DHCPStaticLease *lease = NULL;","         Network *network = ASSERT_PTR(userdata);","         struct ether_addr hwaddr;","-        uint8_t *c;","         int r;"," ","         assert(filename);","@@ -186,8 +226,7 @@ int config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_hwaddr(","                 return log_oom();"," ","         if (isempty(rvalue)) {","-                lease->client_id = mfree(lease->client_id);","-                lease->client_id_size = 0;","+                lease->hw_addr = ETHER_ADDR_NULL;","                 TAKE_PTR(lease);","                 return 0;","         }","@@ -204,16 +243,76 @@ int config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_hwaddr(","                 return 0;","         }"," ","-        c = new(uint8_t, ETH_ALEN + 1);","-        if (!c)","-                return log_oom();","+        lease->hw_addr = hwaddr;"," ","-        /* set client id type to 1: Ethernet Link-Layer (RFC 2132) */","-        c[0] = 0x01;","-        memcpy(c + 1, &hwaddr, ETH_ALEN);","+        TAKE_PTR(lease);","+        return 0;","+}"," ","-        free_and_replace(lease->client_id, c);","-        lease->client_id_size = ETH_ALEN + 1;","+static int config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_iaid(","+                const char *unit,","+                const char *filename,","+                unsigned line,","+                const char *section,","+                unsigned section_line,","+                const char *lvalue,","+                int ltype,","+                const char *rvalue,","+                void *data,","+                void *userdata) {","+","+        DHCPStaticLease *lease = ASSERT_PTR(userdata);","+        int r;","+","+        assert(rvalue);","+","+        if (isempty(rvalue)) {","+                lease->iaid = 0;","+                lease->iaid_set = false;","+                return 1;","+        }","+","+        r = safe_atou32(rvalue, &lease->iaid);","+        if (r < 0)","+                return log_syntax_parse_error(unit, filename, line, r, lvalue, rvalue);","+","+        lease->iaid_set = true;","+        return 1;","+}","+","+int config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_section(","+                const char *unit,","+                const char *filename,","+                unsigned line,","+                const char *section,","+                unsigned section_line,","+                const char *lvalue,","+                int ltype,","+                const char *rvalue,","+                void *data,","+                void *userdata) {","+","+        static const ConfigSectionParser table[_DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_CONF_PARSER_MAX] = {","+                [DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_CLIENT_IDENTIFIER] = { .parser = config_parse_dhcp_client_identifier, .ltype = 0,    .offset = offsetof(DHCPStaticLease, client_identifier), },","+                [DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_IAID]              = { .parser = config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_iaid, .ltype = 0,    .offset = 0,                                            },","+                [DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_DUID_TYPE]         = { .parser = config_parse_duid_type,              .ltype = true, .offset = offsetof(DHCPStaticLease, duid),              },","+                [DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_DUID_RAW_DATA]     = { .parser = config_parse_duid_rawdata,           .ltype = true, .offset = offsetof(DHCPStaticLease, duid),              },","+        };","+","+        _cleanup_(dhcp_static_lease_free_or_set_invalidp) DHCPStaticLease *lease = NULL;","+        Network *network = ASSERT_PTR(userdata);","+        int r;","+","+        assert(filename);","+","+        r = lease_new_static(network, filename, section_line, &lease);","+        if (r < 0)","+                return log_oom();","+","+        r = config_section_parse(table, ELEMENTSOF(table),","+                                 unit, filename, line, section, section_line, lvalue, ltype, rvalue, lease);","+        if (r <= 0)","+                return r;"," ","         TAKE_PTR(lease);","         return 0;"],"additions":118,"deletions":19,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/network/networkd-dhcp-server-static-lease.h","lines":["@@ -2,8 +2,12 @@"," "," #pragma once"," ","+#include <net/ethernet.h>"," #include <netinet/in.h>"," ","+#include \"dhcp-client-id-internal.h\"","+#include \"networkd-dhcp-common.h\"","+#include \"networkd-dhcp4.h\""," #include \"networkd-forward.h\""," "," typedef struct DHCPStaticLease {","@@ -11,13 +15,27 @@ typedef struct DHCPStaticLease {","         ConfigSection *section;"," ","         struct in_addr address;","-        uint8_t *client_id;","-        size_t client_id_size;","+        struct ether_addr hw_addr;","+        DHCPClientIdentifier client_identifier;","+        uint32_t iaid;","+        bool iaid_set;","+        DUID duid;","+        sd_dhcp_client_id client_id;","         char *hostname;"," } DHCPStaticLease;"," ","+typedef enum DHCPStaticLeaseConfParser {","+        DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_CLIENT_IDENTIFIER,","+        DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_IAID,","+        DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_DUID_TYPE,","+        DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_DUID_RAW_DATA,","+        _DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_CONF_PARSER_MAX,","+        _DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_CONF_PARSER_INVALID = -EINVAL,","+} DHCPStaticLeaseConfParser;","+"," void network_drop_invalid_static_leases(Network *network);"," "," CONFIG_PARSER_PROTOTYPE(config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_address);"," CONFIG_PARSER_PROTOTYPE(config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_hwaddr);","+CONFIG_PARSER_PROTOTYPE(config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_section);"," CONFIG_PARSER_PROTOTYPE(config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_hostname);"],"additions":20,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/network/networkd-dhcp-server.c","lines":["@@ -742,8 +742,8 @@ static int dhcp4_server_configure(Link *link) {","                 r = sd_dhcp_server_set_static_lease(","                                 link->dhcp_server,","                                 &static_lease->address,","-                                static_lease->client_id,","-                                static_lease->client_id_size,","+                                static_lease->client_id.raw,","+                                static_lease->client_id.size,","                                 static_lease->hostname);","                 if (r < 0)","                         return log_link_error_errno(link, r, \"Failed to set DHCPv4 static lease for DHCP server: %m\");"],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/network/networkd-network-gperf.gperf","lines":["@@ -410,6 +410,10 @@ DHCPServer.PersistLeases,                        config_parse_dhcp_server_persis"," DHCPServer.LocalLeaseDomain,                     config_parse_dns_name,                          0,                                      offsetof(Network, dhcp_server_local_lease_domain)"," DHCPServerStaticLease.Address,                   config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_address,         0,                                      0"," DHCPServerStaticLease.MACAddress,                config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_hwaddr,          0,                                      0","+DHCPServerStaticLease.ClientIdentifier,          config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_section,         DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_CLIENT_IDENTIFIER,    0","+DHCPServerStaticLease.IAID,                      config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_section,         DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_IAID,                 0","+DHCPServerStaticLease.DUIDType,                  config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_section,         DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_DUID_TYPE,            0","+DHCPServerStaticLease.DUIDRawData,               config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_section,         DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_DUID_RAW_DATA,        0"," DHCPServerStaticLease.Hostname,                  config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_hostname,        0,                                      0"," Bridge.Cost,                                     config_parse_uint32,                            0,                                      offsetof(Network, cost)"," Bridge.UseBPDU,                                  config_parse_tristate,                          0,                                      offsetof(Network, use_bpdu)"],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/network/test-networkd-conf.c","lines":["@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@"," #include \"hexdecoct.h\""," #include \"net-condition.h\""," #include \"networkd-address.h\"","+#include \"networkd-dhcp-server-static-lease.h\""," #include \"networkd-manager.h\""," #include \"networkd-network.h\""," #include \"networkd-route.h\"","@@ -238,6 +239,117 @@ TEST(config_parse_address) {","         test_config_parse_address_one(\"::1/-1\", AF_INET6, 0, NULL, 0);"," }"," ","+static void test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(","+                const char *hwaddr,","+                const char *client_identifier,","+                const char *iaid,","+                const char *duid_type,","+                const char *duid_rawdata,","+                const void *expected,","+                size_t expected_size) {","+","+        static const struct {","+                const char *lvalue;","+                DHCPStaticLeaseConfParser ltype;","+        } settings[] = {","+                { \"ClientIdentifier\", DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_CLIENT_IDENTIFIER },","+                { \"IAID\",             DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_IAID              },","+                { \"DUIDType\",         DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_DUID_TYPE         },","+                { \"DUIDRawData\",      DHCP_STATIC_LEASE_DUID_RAW_DATA     },","+        };","+        const char *values[] = { client_identifier, iaid, duid_type, duid_rawdata };","+        _cleanup_(manager_freep) Manager *manager = NULL;","+        _cleanup_(network_unrefp) Network *network = NULL;","+        DHCPStaticLease *lease;","+","+        assert_cc(ELEMENTSOF(settings) == ELEMENTSOF(values));","+","+        log_debug(\"/* %s(MACAddress=%s, ClientIdentifier=%s, IAID=%s, DUIDType=%s, DUIDRawData=%s) */\",","+                  __func__, strnull(hwaddr), strnull(client_identifier), strnull(iaid),","+                  strnull(duid_type), strnull(duid_rawdata));","+","+        ASSERT_OK(manager_new(&manager, /* test_mode= */ true));","+        ASSERT_NOT_NULL(network = new0(Network, 1));","+        network->n_ref = 1;","+        network->manager = manager;","+        ASSERT_NOT_NULL(network->filename = strdup(\"hogehoge.network\"));","+","+        ASSERT_OK_ZERO(config_parse_match_ifnames(\"network\", \"filename\", 1, \"section\", 1, \"Name\", 0, \"*\",","+                                                  &network->match.ifname, network));","+        ASSERT_OK_ZERO(config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_address(","+                                       \"network\", \"filename\", 1, \"section\", 1,","+                                       \"Address\", 0, \"10.1.1.2\", NULL, network));","+        if (hwaddr)","+                ASSERT_OK_ZERO(config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_hwaddr(","+                                               \"network\", \"filename\", 1, \"section\", 1,","+                                               \"MACAddress\", 0, hwaddr, NULL, network));","+        FOREACH_ELEMENT(setting, settings) {","+                const char *v = values[setting - settings];","+","+                if (v)","+                        ASSERT_OK_ZERO(config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_section(","+                                                       \"network\", \"filename\", 1, \"section\", 1,","+                                                       setting->lvalue, setting->ltype, v, NULL, network));","+        }","+        ASSERT_OK(network_verify(network));","+","+        if (!expected) {","+                ASSERT_TRUE(hashmap_isempty(network->dhcp_static_leases_by_section));","+                return;","+        }","+","+        ASSERT_EQ(hashmap_size(network->dhcp_static_leases_by_section), 1u);","+        ASSERT_NOT_NULL(lease = hashmap_first(network->dhcp_static_leases_by_section));","+        ASSERT_EQ(lease->client_id.size, expected_size);","+        ASSERT_EQ(memcmp(lease->client_id.raw, expected, expected_size), 0);","+}","+","+TEST(config_parse_dhcp_static_lease) {","+        static const uint8_t by_hwaddr[] = { 0x01, 0x12, 0x34, 0x56, 0x78, 0x9a, 0xbc };","+        static const uint8_t by_iaid_duid[] = {","+                0xff,                   /* type: IAID and DUID */","+                0x12, 0x34, 0x56, 0x78, /* IAID */","+                0x00, 0x02,             /* DUID type: vendor */","+                0x00, 0x00, 0xab, 0x11, /* DUID data */","+        };","+        static const uint8_t by_iaid_duid_numeric_type[] = {","+                0xff,                   /* type: IAID and DUID */","+                0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x01, /* IAID */","+                0x12, 0x34,             /* DUID type: 0x1234 */","+                0xab,                   /* DUID data */","+        };","+","+        /* ClientIdentifier=mac, the default */","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(\"12:34:56:78:9a:bc\", NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL,","+                                                by_hwaddr, sizeof(by_hwaddr));","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(\"12:34:56:78:9a:bc\", \"mac\", NULL, NULL, NULL,","+                                                by_hwaddr, sizeof(by_hwaddr));","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(\"12:34:56:78:9a:bc\", \"mac\", \"0x12345678\", \"vendor\", \"00:00:ab:11\",","+                                                by_hwaddr, sizeof(by_hwaddr));","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0);","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(NULL, \"mac\", \"0x12345678\", \"vendor\", \"00:00:ab:11\", NULL, 0);","+","+        /* ClientIdentifier=duid, MACAddress= is ignored */","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(NULL, \"duid\", \"0x12345678\", \"vendor\", \"00:00:ab:11\",","+                                                by_iaid_duid, sizeof(by_iaid_duid));","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(\"12:34:56:78:9a:bc\", \"duid\", \"0x12345678\", \"vendor\", \"00:00:AB:11\",","+                                                by_iaid_duid, sizeof(by_iaid_duid));","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(NULL, \"duid\", \"1\", \"4660\", \"ab\",","+                                                by_iaid_duid_numeric_type, sizeof(by_iaid_duid_numeric_type));","+","+        /* ClientIdentifier=duid without IAID=, DUIDType=, or DUIDRawData= */","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(\"12:34:56:78:9a:bc\", \"duid\", NULL, \"vendor\", \"00:00:ab:11\", NULL, 0);","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(\"12:34:56:78:9a:bc\", \"duid\", \"0x12345678\", NULL, \"00:00:ab:11\", NULL, 0);","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(\"12:34:56:78:9a:bc\", \"duid\", \"0x12345678\", \"vendor\", NULL, NULL, 0);","+","+        /* Invalid values make the section dropped */","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(\"12:34:56:78:9a:bc\", \"duid\", \"-1\", \"vendor\", \"00:00:ab:11\", NULL, 0);","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(\"12:34:56:78:9a:bc\", \"duid\", \"0x12345678\", \"hoge\", \"00:00:ab:11\", NULL, 0);","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(\"12:34:56:78:9a:bc\", \"duid\", \"0x12345678\", \"vendor\", \"00:xy\", NULL, 0);","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(\"12:34:56:78:9a:bc\", \"hoge\", \"0x12345678\", \"vendor\", \"00:00:ab:11\", NULL, 0);","+        test_config_parse_dhcp_static_lease_one(\"12:34:56:78:9a:bc\", \"mac\", NULL, \"hoge\", NULL, NULL, 0);","+}","+"," TEST(config_parse_match_ifnames) {","         _cleanup_strv_free_ char **names = NULL;"," "],"additions":112,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"test/fuzz/fuzz-network-parser/dhcp-server-static-lease","lines":["@@ -29,3 +29,10 @@ Address=10.1.1.4"," [DHCPServerStaticLease]"," MACAddress=12:34:56:78:9a:bf"," Address=10.1.1.5","+","+[DHCPServerStaticLease]","+ClientIdentifier=duid","+IAID=0x12345678","+DUIDType=vendor","+DUIDRawData=00:00:ab:11","+Address=10.1.1.6"],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"test/test-network/conf/25-dhcp-client-static-lease-client-id.network","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@","+# SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later","+[Match]","+Name=veth99","+","+[Network]","+IPv6AcceptRA=no","+DHCP=ipv4","+","+[DHCPv4]","+ClientIdentifier=duid","+IAID=0x12345678","+DUIDType=vendor","+DUIDRawData=00:00:ab:11"],"additions":13,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"test/test-network/conf/25-dhcp-server-static-lease-client-id.network","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@","+# SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later","+[Match]","+Name=veth-peer","+","+[Network]","+IPv6AcceptRA=no","+Address=10.1.1.1/24","+DHCPServer=yes","+","+[DHCPServer]","+PoolOffset=0","+PoolSize=20","+","+[DHCPServerStaticLease]","+ClientIdentifier=duid","+IAID=0x12345678","+DUIDType=vendor","+DUIDRawData=00:00:ab:11","+Address=10.1.1.201","+","+# The client identifier sent by the cl